{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月24日，據Business Insider報道，英偉達宣佈恢復黃仁勳CEO職務，距離其宣佈辭職僅過去11天。黃仁勳由此加入了科技商業史上一個為數不多的創始人羣體：在被迫離開公司權力中心後，重新奪回公司的領導權。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587810.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:04:08.399412+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T07:47:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T07:57:12.446417+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T07:57:12.446417+00:00","content_hash":"f7a20437e6041029ee5541b232dec2c0f68c605db010df2d5a7bd1a294812c11","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}